"Proxy changes apply to downloads started afterwards. Password-protected downloads: add the user name and password in the Add window or under Properties." = "Faʻaaoga suiga o le proxy mo le faʻaigoaina o faʻapipiʻiga ua amataina. Faʻapipiʻi faʻatapulaʻaina: faʻaopopo le igoa o le tagata faʻaoga ma le upu faataga i le 'Add' window poʻo i lalo o 'Properties'.";
